# Instapose-App

<H2> Instapose App Privacy Policy </h2>

"Instapose" is a free photography app that helps users discover and recreate different photography poses using AI recommendations, pose templates, camera features, and visual pose overlays.

This page is used to inform visitors regarding our policies with the collection, use, and disclosure of personal information if anyone decided to use our service.


<H3> Collecting Information </H3>

Instapose allows users to create an account to access and use certain features of the app.

Depending on the sign-in method used, we may collect information such as:

- Name or display name
- Email address
- Profile information
- Authentication information
- User-generated content and preferences

This information is used to create and manage your Instapose account and provide app functionality.

Instapose uses Google Firebase services to securely manage account authentication and application data.

We do not sell, rent, or trade users' personal information.


<H3> Firebase Services </H3>

Instapose uses Firebase, a service provided by Google, to support certain features of the application.

Firebase may be used for:

- User authentication
- Account management
- Secure storage of application data
- Cloud database services
- Application performance and security
- Crash reporting, if enabled

Information processed by Firebase is handled according to Google's applicable privacy practices.

For more information about Google's privacy practices, please visit:

https://policies.google.com/privacy


<H3> Camera and Photos/Videos </H3>

Instapose may request access to your device camera and photos/videos when you use features that require them.

These permissions may be used for:

- Taking photographs
- Recording videos
- Selecting photos or videos from your gallery
- Using a photo as a pose reference
- Using a photo as a pose template
- Using template-based camera overlays
- AI-powered pose recommendations and guidance

Camera and media access is only used when you choose a feature that requires it.

Instapose does not access your camera or personal media in the background.

Where supported, Instapose uses the Android system photo picker to allow users to select specific photos or videos.


<H3> AI Features </H3>

Instapose provides AI-powered features such as pose recommendations, pose guidance, and template recommendations.

AI features may process information required to provide the requested functionality.

If a feature requires an image or other user-provided content to be processed by an external AI service, the applicable content may be transmitted to that service for processing.

Instapose does not use users' photos or videos for advertising purposes.


<H3> Content Usage </H3>

The pose images displayed in Instapose are curated from publicly available sources, primarily Pinterest.

These images are posted by real people and may include faces or identifiable features.

Instapose does not claim ownership of any images shown in the app.

All credits and rights belong to the original creators or photographers.

Images are used solely for educational and reference purposes to guide photography poses.

If you are the rightful owner of any image used and want it removed, please contact us via the email below. We will promptly remove the content upon verification.


<H3> Third-Party Services </H3>

Instapose uses third-party services to provide certain application functionality.

These services may include Google Firebase and other services required for authentication, cloud storage, database functionality, AI processing, crash reporting, analytics, or application security.

Third-party service providers may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable agreements.

We do not sell users' personal information to third parties.


<H3> Data Storage and Security </H3>

Account information and other application data may be stored using Firebase and related cloud services.

We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.


<H3> Data Retention and Account Deletion </H3>

We retain account information for as long as your Instapose account remains active or as necessary to provide the requested services.

You may request deletion of your Instapose account and associated personal information by contacting us at:

📧 Email: 02xdeveloper@gmail.com

When an account deletion request is verified, we will delete or anonymize applicable account information, subject to information that we are legally required or permitted to retain.


<H3> Children's Privacy </H3>

While the app is safe for general use, it is not intended for children under 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

If we become aware that we have collected personal information from a child under 13, we will take appropriate steps to delete such information.


